{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833430/extras/CherryBlossom.gif?t=1740894259\" />A boy forced to work in the bath house, not knowing where he is and having no idea how he magically got transported there, he meets several unusual animal-like spirits that are guests to this bath house. He must satisfy their customer needs. Whether it's cleaning the bathtub, wiping down the floor, dusting off the cob webs, chucking coal into the boiler or cooking an exotic meal, he must find a way back home as some spirits are eyeing on him, wondering if he's tasty to eat. Be careful around other spirits because they either want to eat you or trick you into doing something dangerous.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2833430?t=1740894259","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740894259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740894259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740894259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Support the Kickstarter!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I traveled to Japan to capture its essence\u2014bathhouse serenity, yokai whispers, the weight of tradition. With my two artists, we are showcasing our game's vision to bring this game to life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m Kevin, an indie dev who poured my heart into <u>Harvest Island</u>. Now, with an amazing artist by my side, <u>A Journey's End</u> is my next big dream\u2014 a game about a boy that is forced to work in the bathhouse and he must escape before the spirit feast festival arrives which is very much inspired by the anime movie Spirited Away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please support us on kickstarter!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833430/extras/CherryBlossom.gif?t=1740894259\" />A boy forced to work in the bath house, not knowing where he is and having no idea how he magically got transported there, he meets several unusual animal-like spirits that are guests to this bath house. He must satisfy their customer needs. Whether it's cleaning the bathtub, wiping down the floor, dusting off the cob webs, chucking coal into the boiler or cooking an exotic meal, he must find a way back home as some spirits are eyeing on him, wondering if he's tasty to eat. Be careful around other spirits because they either want to eat you or trick you into doing something dangerous.</p>","developers":["Yobob"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833430/header.jpg?t=1740894259","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"A Journey's End","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 10th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 3060</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Yobob Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo\nAtos criminosos","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_ga